  "item_short_desc": "<p>Show your support for law enforcement with Rothco's Thin Blue Line Flag MA-1 Flight Jacket. This classic flight jacket features a sleek design with a prominently displayed Thin Blue Line flag, symbolizing respect and solidarity with police and law enforcement officials. Crafted from a 100% nylon water-repellent outer shell, this bomber jacket is designed to keep you dry and comfortable in various weather conditions.</p>",
